WEBVTT

00:12:29.484 --> 00:12:31.405
i mudro prakticiranje

00:12:31.405 --> 00:12:33.396
politike identiteta trebalo bi proširiti

00:12:33.396 --> 00:12:35.923
našu ideju onoga što znači biti čovjek.

00:12:35.923 --> 00:12:37.641
Identitet sam po sebi

00:12:37.641 --> 00:12:40.190
ne bi trebao biti samodopadna odlika

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.274
ili zlatna medalja

00:12:42.274 --> 00:12:44.747
već revolucija.

00:12:44.747 --> 00:12:48.313
Imao bih puno lakši život 
da sam "straight",

00:12:48.313 --> 00:12:50.110
ali to ne bih bio ja,

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:52.775
i sada više volim biti ja

00:12:52.775 --> 00:12:54.828
nego netko drugi,

00:12:54.828 --> 00:12:56.476
netko tko, zapravo,

00:12:56.476 --> 00:12:58.560
nemam ni opciju biti

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.037
niti mogućnost da u potpunosti zamislim.